{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03220","headline":"洞庭湖 · 宋之问","name":"洞庭湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地尽天水合，朝及洞庭湖。\n初日当中涌，莫辨东西隅。\n晶耀目何在，滢荧心欲无。\n灵光晏海若，游气耿天吴。\n张乐轩皇至，征苗夏禹徂。\n楚臣悲落叶，尧女泣苍梧。\n野积九江润，山通五岳图。\n风恬鱼自跃，云夕雁相呼。\n独此临泛漾，浩将人代殊。\n永言洗氛浊，卒岁爲清娱。\n要使功成退，徒劳越大夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}